        "This cell creates the deliberately small synthetic classification dataset. The data are random/generated by design and contain a restricted feature space.\n",
        "\n",
        "The purpose is not to claim real-world generalization from synthetic data. Instead, the controlled dataset makes it possible to observe whether the quantum/classical model can learn a structured decision boundary while the correction framework simultaneously separates measurement/contextual residuals.\n",
