        "\\frac{1}{N}\n",
        "\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\n",
        "\\mathbf 1(\\hat y_i=y_i).\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "The F1 score balances precision and recall:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "F_1\n",
        "=\n",
        "2\\frac{\\mathrm{Precision}\\cdot\\mathrm{Recall}}\n",
        "{\\mathrm{Precision}+\\mathrm{Recall}}.\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
